        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMRC-DYL, Modern Dylan Knobset with Square Marcel Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to fit on many standard pre-drilled doors, the Modern Dylan Knob with Marcel Rose comes packaged as a complete set. This modern knob has an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Modern Dylan Knobset with Square Marcel Rose fits standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. Choose from the modern finish color options in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Yale Expressions Dylan Knob with Modern Marcel Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Dylan Knob with Marcel Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry has a Schlage C keyway.</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMRC25-DYL-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YMRC-DYL Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. \r\nKnob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face). Package Includes: \r\n2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch \r\noperates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, \r\nstrike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. \r\nLatch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock \r\non both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Package Includes: \r\n2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Keyed:</b> Guarded latchbolt operated from outside by key; inside by knob. \r\nTurnbutton on the interior locks outside knob. Outside knob unlocks by key. \r\nComplete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Dylan Knob with Marcel Rose",
                "description": "Designed to fit on many standard pre-drilled doors, the Modern Dylan Knob with Marcel Rose comes packaged as a complete set. This modern knob has an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Modern Dylan Knobset with Square Marcel Rose fits standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. Choose from the modern finish color options in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed function.",
